# The data are not kept in version control: 1.3 GB in all, most of it in 67,532
# workbooks. get_data.py downloads the ECB's logs and builds from them what is
# asked for (see README.md). The small files that describe the data are kept: the
# list of series, the vintage dates and the fingerprints of the published build.
